{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0631e6b00ba8b4d6f75fd2c1c1e836145218356f85cf41e01a2bd059f8aa94ef", "ja": "（今日は『STARDOM ROAD』の稽古中。\nエレナはひとりで、居残り練習をしている）", "zh": "（今天正在排练《STARDOM ROAD》。艾蕾娜一个人留下来练习。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "dbac3bee7ad2fe4e8aeef17056b06afcfae9b339e62cea86a71f079d3ed0c3eb", "ja": "う～ん。ちょっと違うかナ……。", "zh": "唔——好像有点不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "739bda87a433cc536f10dd4f15776c1aaa965e8286690c64ed21b1406252ad42", "ja": "もう一回やってみようっと。\n『芸能界っていう違う世界に飛び込んだんだから……』", "zh": "再试一次好啦。\n“既然一头扎进了演艺界这个截然不同的世界……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1003_se", "source_sha256": "c74fe1347b40e5de08740c4e6cdbee19ed4fec46e3367283768297481276714f", "ja": "バタバタバタ！　……バタン！", "zh": "扑通扑通扑！……啪嗒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "3cdcf9018a8969e0ab1cd7e0402d591e85e81224d40e215823d8ffc9a27641af", "ja": "{$P$}！　お待たせ～！", "zh": "{$P$}！让你久等啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4125224a7ae75a710986eb0720bd0589f94da93af63c3598b5afa59477613ffa", "ja": "いや、そんなに待ってないよ。\nエレナこそお疲れ様、遅くまで大変だったな。", "zh": "不，我也没等多久。\n艾莲娜才辛苦了呢，这么晚真是够受的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "2820d108b22737776d4e0319947ca6d9e58ffe69a460b97f44bb905a607cd4f0", "ja": "場当たりが近いからネ！　みんなが、ワタシたちの\n一番いい見え方を考えてくれるから、がんばらないと。", "zh": "因为走位排练快到了嘛！大家都在帮我们\n考虑怎样呈现才最棒，所以我也得加油才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "eae685793b375c7db6e7ac6f85fc7d40c2a444f1ae3f7f45333f7e55d94a57a3", "ja": "それより{$P$}、メグミたちは？\nもう帰っちゃった？", "zh": "比起那个，{$P$}，惠美她们呢？已经回去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d5b48517c6e9b1f06a451ff35a143e164edcdd7d465002f56aac28e5ccce3c3b", "ja": "ああ。残りたいって言ってたんだけど、\n明日もあるから先に帰ってもらったよ。", "zh": "啊。虽然她们说想留下来，但因为明天还有事，就让她们先回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "0e95b644f714dcfc5e0c86abe3c46c96729143b784a1ba16e95e5d67236abe87", "ja": "だよネ～。\nちょっとでいいから、話したかったナ。", "zh": "就是啊～\n哪怕聊一会儿也好，我本来想和她说说话的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8cbd6483d8f3711d8051434d8fdf03f8d46f6c2d4a77d7da9c343594db08de9f", "ja": "何か用があったのか？", "zh": "有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "dffdc6dadad0d7aa58bfac225a0eb5a5d4087cf34d1b9b300eb76e4ebc7f0919", "ja": "用事はないんだけど……。あのネ、\n今回のワタシの役、すごくツンってしてるでショ？", "zh": "虽然没什么事……那个呀，\n这次我演的角色，是不是特别傲娇？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "f595a1f138b3e3e577d285b5879cd982f042e4f3beefacfccbed3b51b7642069", "ja": "楽しいんだけど、ずっとだと寂しくなっちゃうんだ。\nだからみんなとお喋りしたいナって思ったんだけど……", "zh": "虽然很开心，但一直这样下去也会觉得寂寞呢。\n所以我就想着，想和大家聊聊天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1013_p", "source_sha256": "37f314b5fd5e5b90dfc6fac80aa76caa8fed812ffa869d2daf62737196df0902", "ja": "そうだったのか。確かに、いつものエレナとはだいぶ\n違う役柄だし……頑張って気持ちを作ってたんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。确实，这次的角色和往常的艾蕾娜大不一样……你一直在努力调整自己的心情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "ab9117f607fe645abf2355cfe28ac8ee3cce0803b6fee708dc5e0cd09919eddf", "ja": "あ、藍のコトは大好きだよ？\nすっごくカッコいいしネ！", "zh": "啊，我最喜欢蓝了哦？\n而且超级帅气的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "3f7409c6ac28753a8e6f5d369eb47df14ee548b852a4190b1a8a9b71b7b8888f", "ja": "……でも、温度差がある？　っていうノ？\nなんだか風邪引いちゃいそう……みたいナ？", "zh": "……可是，所谓的温差？是这个意思吗？\n总觉得好像要感冒了……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c02a685d58540832e9309ade2562487d5f1b88e2b225c4d4f7b8a832b877a7e2", "ja": "そうか。エレナに風邪を引かれると困るな。", "zh": "这样啊。要是艾琳娜感冒了，可就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4360b82090c400013dec275043043866370a3869c0431e188ac7f69f454c5067", "ja": "それじゃ、帰りにどこかに寄っていこうか。\n恵美達とじゃなくて悪いけど、お茶でもどうだ？", "zh": "那我们回去的时候，去哪里顺便逛逛吧。\n虽然不是和惠美她们一起，但要不要去喝杯茶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "407ce72e44a8b8f489fd95f94b0972589c7784f7ed33e392a83ee2e20b19c620", "ja": "いいノ！？　やったー！\n{$P$}、すっごくうれしいヨ～！", "zh": "可以吗！？太好啦——！\n{$P$}，我超级开心的哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "53f832189e365299c7f04403672609d39ad6987a568c8a23aeef5ae3cc9f8416", "ja": "ねーねー、どこに行く？　ワタシは\n{$P$}と一緒なら、どこでもいいヨ！", "zh": "喂喂，我们要去哪儿？只要和\n{$P$}一起，去哪儿都可以哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0493_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7deda9a872c4278c1c1feca57f248226138a4e78bbad682beb3755b4224ff28a", "ja": "（エレナがこんなに頑張ってるんだ。\nプロデューサーとして、全力で応援しないとな！）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜都这么努力了。\n我作为制作人，也必须全力支持她才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
